### Laboratorios cadastrados
GET http://localhost:8080/api/labs

### Horarios livres do Laboratorio de Robotica em uma data
GET http://localhost:8080/api/labs/2/availability?date=2026-11-20

### Reservar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "laboratoryId": 2,
  "requesterName": "Kauan Marques",
  "requesterEmail": "kauan@example.com",
  "purpose": "Testes do robo de sumo",
  "attendees": 6,
  "startsAt": "2026-11-20T14:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-20T16:00"
}

### Minhas reservas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations?email=kauan@example.com

### Cancelar (somente quem reservou)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "requesterEmail": "kauan@example.com" }
